{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2023-05-02 11:30:00', 'title': 'BANK OF AMERICA AWARDS NEGRO LEAGUES BASEBALL MUSEUM $1M GRANT FOR NEW FACILITY', 'text': "NEW MUSEUM WILL FURTHER TELL THE POWERFUL STORIES OF THE NEGRO LEAGUES BASEBALL PLAYERS KANSAS CITY, MO. , MAY 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE NEGRO LEAGUES BASEBALL MUSEUM (NLBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN AWARDED A $1 MILLION GRANT FROM BANK OF AMERICA IN SUPPORT OF THE MUSEUM'S $25 MILLION CAPITAL CAMPAIGN TO BUILD A NEW 30,000 SQUARE-FOOT FACILITY."}